alttools (0.3.2-1) unstable; urgency=low

  * Add per-process CPU affinity (Set Affinity... dialog, one checkbox
    per core).
  * Add "Open File Location" and "Copy Process Info" to the process
    context menu.

 -- AlternativeI Project <unset@example.invalid>  Thu, 27 Aug 2026 12:00:00 +0000

alttools (0.3.1-1) unstable; urgency=low

  * Add Suspend/Resume for a process (Linux SIGSTOP/SIGCONT, Windows
    NtSuspendProcess/NtResumeProcess).
  * Add "Terminate process tree" - terminates a selected process together
    with all of its descendants.

 -- AlternativeI Project <unset@example.invalid>  Thu, 27 Aug 2026 12:00:00 +0000

alttools (0.2.1-1) unstable; urgency=low

  * Add "Settings" (language, process-list refresh interval) and "About"
    buttons to the main toolbar.
  * Full English/Russian UI localization, switchable from Settings
    (takes effect after a restart, which Settings offers to do).
  * Freeze the process list's periodic refresh while Ctrl is held, so
    Ctrl-clicking to multi-select no longer gets rows reordered out from
    under the pointer.

 -- AlternativeI Project <unset@example.invalid>  Thu, 27 Aug 2026 12:00:00 +0000

alttools (0.1.0-1) unstable; urgency=low

  * Initial release: process tree view, per-process properties dialog
    (threads/modules/memory/handles/environment/network), system
    performance graphs, services manager tab, and the diskutil CLI for
    SHA-256-verified MBR/GPT/disk backup and restore.

